{"title":"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The scalene triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has side lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/e/78e5ec10b802d2c4ee3e36981c70b593b1100405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$51, 52, 53.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/f/b3f6f7cd16a47f33bebcf3fc361eeb808b630504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC.$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/5/1f591d390f2c7453f1a1db5777dcbe9eed30220a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(52,0)--(24,sqrt(3)*26)--cycle); draw((24,0)--(24,sqrt(3)*26)); draw((0,-8)--(52,-8),arrow=Arrow()); draw((52,-8)--(0,-8),arrow=Arrow()); draw((24,3)--(21,3)--(21,0),black); MP(&quot;B&quot;,(0,0),SW);MP(&quot;A&quot;,(24,sqrt(3)*26),N);MP(&quot;C&quot;,(52,0),SE);MP(&quot;D&quot;,(24,0),S); MP(&quot;52&quot;,(26,-8),S);MP(&quot;53&quot;,(38,sqrt(3)*13),NE);MP(&quot;51&quot;,(12,sqrt(3)*13),NW); [/asy]\" width=\"248\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>(a) Determine the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0edb6ba307f77287794310f53f3d7586c5ff6d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD.$\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>(b) Determine the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd222166def59a3315433877917a826de6488031.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will solve both parts at once since it is easy to get the two answers from this all-inclusive solution.\n</p><p>Heron's Formula states that in a triangle with sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d73a198449b2d2566597a7dff0128f5b063e31b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = \\frac{a + b + c}{2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" /> the area is given by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/3777ec93b0beb3be1569c6b6bec9537f88bf6d47.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{s(s - a)(s - b)(s - c)}.\\]\" width=\"188\" height=\"32\" /> We plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/a/2ca3508bb69d7e0630d7af04c60fa01ee3b66bd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 52, b = 53, c = 51.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"172\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/7/95702f4f1c063eeacf355fd0c8f52baf1570fa13.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} s &amp;= \\dfrac{51 + 52 + 53}{2} = \\dfrac{3 \\cdot 52}{2} = 3 \\cdot 26 = 78 \\\\ [ABC] &amp;= \\sqrt{78(78 - 51)(78 - 52)(78 - 53)} = \\sqrt{78(27)(26)(25)} = 5 \\sqrt{(3 \\cdot 26)\\left(3^3\\right)(2 \\cdot 13)} \\\\ &amp;= 5 \\cdot 3 \\sqrt{3 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 13 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 13} = 15 \\sqrt{2^2 \\cdot 3^2 \\cdot 13^2} = 15 \\sqrt{(2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 13)}^2 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{1170} \\end{align*}\" width=\"683\" height=\"149\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/7/f7709d83f96dddbe5ad579cd33d307d8a533cda2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABC] = \\frac{bh}{2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"103\" height=\"37\" /> we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc46c05482c13f6a4c2c88bdfea73b24c434a2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1170 = \\frac{AD \\cdot 52}{2} = 26 \\cdot AD.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"217\" height=\"39\" /> Solving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a51cf23aed0909b61a15fb67c86083693cc937a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = 45.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /> Remembering our 8-15-17 Pythagorean triple, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b58ab304c6ae8de111385cb8e730f6612607a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = \\boxed{24}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"23\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6cf65b1f2fbdf388e3daeff9b96b34d3399d777.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\square$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II\">1993 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017080748\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 139/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1362/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 99/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3802/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.311      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%   10.311      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13625:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017080748 and revision id 174312. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}